    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set Sail and Live the Life of a True Mariner!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/fb87ce82b550a3b59c18d063f675afc9.poster.avif?t=1744914820\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/fb87ce82b550a3b59c18d063f675afc9.webm?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/fb87ce82b550a3b59c18d063f675afc9.mp4?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the vast open sea, where adventure, trade, and discovery await. <i>Open Sea Simulator</i> lets you experience the freedom of a sailor\u2019s life\u2014whether you're fishing, shipping cargo, exploring bustling port cities, or simply enjoying a quiet moment on the water with a cup of coffee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fishing \u2013 From Hobby to Industry</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/278d3b8d2e6cff4d1324a4abacfc3e9c.poster.avif?t=1744914820\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/278d3b8d2e6cff4d1324a4abacfc3e9c.webm?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/278d3b8d2e6cff4d1324a4abacfc3e9c.mp4?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reel in the catch of the day! Start with simple rod fishing or dive into large-scale industrial fishing with specialized vessels. Upgrade your gear, master different techniques, and sell your haul at local markets to grow your fishing empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Transport &amp; Delivery \u2013 Build a Maritime Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/9233ca044107e12b5d3685683c232e74.poster.avif?t=1744914820\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/9233ca044107e12b5d3685683c232e74.webm?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/9233ca044107e12b5d3685683c232e74.mp4?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on shipping contracts, deliver cargo, and optimize your routes for maximum efficiency. Whether it\u2019s a quick package drop-off or a high-risk long-haul journey, every decision counts. Manage fuel, expand your fleet, and ensure on-time deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tourism &amp; Charters \u2013 Become a Luxury Captain</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the sea into your business! Organize scenic cruises, lead whale-watching tours, or offer luxury yacht experiences. Keep passengers happy, upgrade your fleet, and build a reputation as the best tour operator on the water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dynamic World Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/b43e53f418c63c7b4ad74ae67492fe2d.poster.avif?t=1744914820\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/b43e53f418c63c7b4ad74ae67492fe2d.webm?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/b43e53f418c63c7b4ad74ae67492fe2d.mp4?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable storms, navigate realistic waters, and explore stunning port cities. Will you conquer the seas or be at the mercy of the waves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Wishlist Now and Set Sail Soon!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set Sail and Live the Life of a True Mariner!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/fb87ce82b550a3b59c18d063f675afc9.poster.avif?t=1744914820\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/fb87ce82b550a3b59c18d063f675afc9.webm?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/fb87ce82b550a3b59c18d063f675afc9.mp4?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the vast open sea, where adventure, trade, and discovery await. <i>Open Sea Simulator</i> lets you experience the freedom of a sailor\u2019s life\u2014whether you're fishing, shipping cargo, exploring bustling port cities, or simply enjoying a quiet moment on the water with a cup of coffee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fishing \u2013 From Hobby to Industry</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/278d3b8d2e6cff4d1324a4abacfc3e9c.poster.avif?t=1744914820\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/278d3b8d2e6cff4d1324a4abacfc3e9c.webm?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/278d3b8d2e6cff4d1324a4abacfc3e9c.mp4?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reel in the catch of the day! Start with simple rod fishing or dive into large-scale industrial fishing with specialized vessels. Upgrade your gear, master different techniques, and sell your haul at local markets to grow your fishing empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Transport &amp; Delivery \u2013 Build a Maritime Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/9233ca044107e12b5d3685683c232e74.poster.avif?t=1744914820\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/9233ca044107e12b5d3685683c232e74.webm?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/9233ca044107e12b5d3685683c232e74.mp4?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on shipping contracts, deliver cargo, and optimize your routes for maximum efficiency. Whether it\u2019s a quick package drop-off or a high-risk long-haul journey, every decision counts. Manage fuel, expand your fleet, and ensure on-time deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tourism &amp; Charters \u2013 Become a Luxury Captain</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the sea into your business! Organize scenic cruises, lead whale-watching tours, or offer luxury yacht experiences. Keep passengers happy, upgrade your fleet, and build a reputation as the best tour operator on the water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dynamic World Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/b43e53f418c63c7b4ad74ae67492fe2d.poster.avif?t=1744914820\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/b43e53f418c63c7b4ad74ae67492fe2d.webm?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631940/extras/b43e53f418c63c7b4ad74ae67492fe2d.mp4?t=1744914820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable storms, navigate realistic waters, and explore stunning port cities. Will you conquer the seas or be at the mercy of the waves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Wishlist Now and Set Sail Soon!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Set sail in this open-world sailing simulation! Take on transport missions, reel in massive catches, manage a thriving tourism business, or race in high-stakes ship competitions. Explore vibrant cities, navigate dynamic weather, and make your mark on the open sea!",
